WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.733
You need one sheet of paper.

00:00:02.933 --> 00:00:04.890
Coloured on one side is best.

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:07.540
Lay it down with the colour facing up.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.306
Fold the sheet in half, top edge down to the bottom edge.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.798
Fold it in half sideways, then open it again.

00:00:20.998 --> 00:00:22.732
The crease marks the middle.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.766
Fold both top corners down to the middle crease.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.108
Fold the front strip at the bottom up, over the corners.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:47.529
Turn the paper over, and fold the other strip up the same way.

00:00:47.729 --> 00:00:49.004
You have a hat.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:59.409
Now open the hat, and press it flat the other way, so that the two ends meet.

00:00:59.609 --> 00:01:00.860
You get a square.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.153
Fold the bottom corner up to the top.

00:01:08.353 --> 00:01:10.867
Turn over, and do the same on the back.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.364
Open it again, and press it flat into a smaller square.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:30.492
Take the two points at the top, and gently pull them apart.

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:37.350
And there is your boat.

